,"interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line051:m0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"虞𩦎","kind":"person","person_id":"u40_zod_c8p","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line051:m0073","start":73,"end":74,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line051:m0098","start":98,"end":99,"surface":"含","kind":"person","person_id":"mwc_md4_l0g","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line051:m0112","start":112,"end":113,"surface":"含","kind":"person","person_id":"mwc_md4_l0g","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line051:m0114","start":114,"end":115,"surface":"瑜","kind":"person","person_id":"mwc_md4_l0g_B","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":51,"last_line":51,"revision_id":2614273},"source_quote":{"witness":"j98","quote":"敦又忌周劄，殺之而盡滅其族。常從督冉曾、公乘雄等為元帝腹心，敦又害之。以宿衛尚多，奏令三番休二。及敦病篤，詔遣侍中陳晷、散騎常侍虞{{!|𩦎|⿰馬斐}}問疾。時帝將討敦，微服至蕪湖，察其營壘，又屢遣大臣訊問其起居。遷含驃騎大將軍、開府儀同三司，含子瑜散騎常侍。","raw_start":4365,"raw_end":4495,"raw_line":51},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji","book_id":"b-jinshu-098","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line067","text":"近承大將軍困篤綿綿，或云已有不諱，悲怛之情，不能自勝。尋知錢鳳大嚴，欲肆奸逆，朝士忿憤，莫不扼腕。去月二十三日，得征北告，劉遐、陶瞻、蘇峻等深懷憂慮，不謀同辭。都邑大小及二宮宿衛咸懼有往年之掠，不復保其妻孥，是以聖主發赫斯之命，具如檄旨。近有嘉詔，崇兄八命，望兄獎群賢忠義之心，抑奸細不逞之計，當還武昌，盡力籓任。卒奉來告，乃承與犬羊俱下，雖當逼近，猶以罔然。兄立身率素，見信明于門宗，年逾耳順，位極人臣，仲玉、安期亦不足作佳少年，本來門戶，良可惜也！","annotation_status":"reviewed","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line067:m0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"錢鳳","kind":"person","person_id":"762_5c8_663","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line067:m0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"劉遐","kind":"person","person_id":"1eg_4i2_q9u","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line067:m0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"陶瞻","kind":"person","person_id":"5r7_x6g_gtf","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line067:m0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"蘇峻","kind":"person","person_id":"lrg_cze_g1l","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line067:m0203","start":203,"end":205,"surface":"仲玉","kind":"person","person_id":"vd6_zwf_uyq","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line067:m0206","start":206,"end":208,"surface":"安期","kind":"person","person_id":"mwc_md4_l0g_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":67,"last_line":67,"revision_id":2614273},"source_quote":{"witness":"j98","quote":"近承大將軍困篤綿綿，或云已有不諱，悲怛之情，不能自勝。尋知錢鳳大嚴，欲肆奸逆，朝士忿憤，莫不扼腕。去月二十三日，得征北告，劉遐、陶瞻、蘇峻等深懷憂慮，不謀同辭。都邑大小及二宮宿衛咸懼有往年之掠，不復保其妻孥，是以聖主發赫斯之命，具如檄旨。近有嘉詔，崇兄八命，望兄獎群賢忠義之心，抑奸細不逞之計，當還武昌，盡力籓任。卒奉來告，乃承與犬羊俱下，雖當逼近，猶以罔然。兄立身率素，見信明于門宗，年逾耳順，位極人臣，仲玉、安期亦不足作佳少年，本來門戶，良可惜也！","raw_start":5649,"raw_end":5875,"raw_line":67},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji","book_id":"b-jinshu-098","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-098","source_id":"s-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji","source":{"title":"晉書卷九十八","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2614273","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2614273","revision_id":2614273,"accessed_on":"2026-10-18","extent":"卷九十八王敦題下完整傳文。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文及維基文庫數位轉錄；保留見證歸屬。","license_url":